  "ruleText": "Ncr 734.05 Personal Belongings. Clothing and other personal belongings shall only be left in designated areas and at the owner’s own risk and shall not be the responsibility of the department.\n\nSource. #14055 EMERGENCY, EXPIRED: 2-15-25\n\nNew. #14291, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
